  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for assertion-level timing budgets. Provides duration formatting and rendering helpers for failure-message context, plus ObservableTimeProvider, a TimeProvider decorator that tracks undisposed timers for leak detection in hosted-service tests. Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages (TimeAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand).",
